{"id":"int-199c6c9d42156b5734f087a627d5d581","kind":"field_change","created_at":"2026-08-20T04:55:45.577859349Z","actor":"ghost666ak","issue_id":"calcrepo_6d0819fe-v4h","extra":{"field":"status","new_value":"closed","old_value":"in_progress","reason":"SW now precaches every <script src>/<link href> from index.html at install + on max-upgrade (extractAssetUrls + precacheDiscoveredAssets, VERSION bumped to calcrepo-v23). Stopped deleting index.html on 404; offline asset misses now serve the cached SPA shell so React's error boundary / stale-bundle recovery can take over instead of blanking the page. Verified: typecheck, lint, all 231 unit tests, production build (dist/) and GitHub Pages build (docs/) all clean. Playwright E2E can't run in this sandbox (missing libglib-2.0.so.0); new offline test added that exercises shell + ProgrammerView + ToolsView chunks; please run npx playwright test locally to confirm on a real device."}}
{"id":"int-85b8ccbafdb6d6c986866c28645bfb59","kind":"field_change","created_at":"2026-08-20T05:16:42.870313297Z","actor":"ghost666ak","issue_id":"calcrepo_6d0819fe-4ex","extra":{"field":"status","new_value":"closed","old_value":"in_progress","reason":"Build-time precache manifest + navigation preload are live (commit 70fed9b, served as calcrepo-v25). Verified: live SW has VERSION=calcrepo-v25, precacheBuildManifest, navigationPreload.enable; precache-manifest.json serves 22 entries on GH Pages. CI workflow committed locally (72d7eb2) but cannot be pushed from this session: OAuth token has scopes codespace,repo,user:email and is missing 'workflow'. Both git push and Contents API reject workflow files without that scope, and gh auth refresh is blocked because GH_TOKEN is environment-set (no interactive auth possible). User needs to: (1) unset GH_TOKEN, run 'gh auth refresh -h github.com -s workflow', then 'git push origin mainBranch'; or (2) push the workflow commit themselves with their own credentials."}}
